Open terminal and clone the repo:

(IN TERMINAL)
> git clone https://github.com/<YOUR_USERNAME>/Travalos.git
> cd Travalos/travalos-backend


Install the dependencies and start the backend:

(IN TERMINAL)
> pip install -r requirements.txt
> uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000


Open "http://localhost:8000" in browser to run it.
